TI  - Comparing the impact of high pressure, pulsed electric field and thermal pasteurization on quality attributes of cloudy apple juice using targeted and untargeted analyses
T2  - Innovative Food Science and Emerging Technologies
PY  - 2019
SP  - 64
EP  - 77
DO  - 10.1016/j.ifset.2019.03.004
