TI  - Biohydrogen synthesis from food waste hydrolysate: Optimization using statistical design of experiments (DoE) and artificial neural network (ANN)
T2  - Biomass and Bioenergy
PY  - 2024
DO  - 10.1016/j.biombioe.2024.107452
